<title>INDIA: Delhi shares turn tail on profit-taking.</title>
<headline>Delhi shares turn tail on profit-taking.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share prices on the Delhi Stock Exchange reversed early trends and closed lower amid profit-taking by investors ahead of the Christmas holidays, brokers said on Monday.</p>
<p>The bourse's benchmark index closed 5.01 points lower at 673.77.</p>
</text>
